# Normalize text files to LF in the repository and in every checkout.
# The Astryx theme build is byte-compared by `npm run check:theme`; mixed
# CRLF/LF endings would make a fresh Windows clone fail that check.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
